nh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....</p>","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/41/57/0d/3c335f64c0ac023e0639e3245a76b86f.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/41/57/0d/3c335f64c0ac023e0639e3245a76b86f.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/41/57/0d/3c335f64c0ac023e0639e3245a76b86f.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/41/57/0d/3c335f64c0ac023e0639e3245a76b86f.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/41/57/0d/3c335f64c0ac023e0639e3245a76b86f.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/59/b8/a4/b9895fb9240aaf8a7e59d8f87ba4e6a9.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/59/b8/a4/b9895fb9240aaf8a7e59d8f87ba4e6a9.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/59/b8/a4/b9895fb9240aaf8a7e59d8f87ba4e6a9.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/59/b8/a4/b9895fb9240aaf8a7e59d8f87ba4e6a9.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/59/b8/a4/b9895fb9240aaf8a7e59d8f87ba4e6a9.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/1d/d8/dd/352a3acf4a244cecdbb8711a24025070.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/1d/d8/dd/352a3acf4a244cecdbb8711a24025070.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/1d/d8/dd/352a3acf4a244cecdbb8711a24025070.jpg","position":null,"small_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/1d/d8/dd/352a3acf4a244cecdbb8711a24025070.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/200x280/ts/product/1d/d8/dd/352a3acf4a244cecdbb8711a24025070.jpg"},{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/c7/33/08/4ddde637587da7bf4e632402a595f8e8.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"ht